## 2. Epic: Required Actions

### US1 — Required Actions Section
Create a "Required actions" section directly below the Welcome Bar.

### US2 — Required Actions: Total Items Due Soon
**As a** branch manager, **I want** a total count of items due next **so that** I know how many items require my immediate attention.
- Display total count of **all** due items grouped by due date:
  - If open items have due dates → `"<Total Number of Items> action items are due <today, tomorrow, or x days>"` + group items by due date, display the next-due group.
  - If open items exist with no due date → `"<Total Number of Items> action items due"`
  - If no open items → `"No action items due"`
- Example from wireframe: `"5 action items are due today."`

### US3 — Required Actions: Control Exceptions
- Source app: **Branch Dashboard** (Business Metric Dashboard — SEAL 84329)
- Data elements: total unresolved exceptions on the Controls Exception tab. **No due date included.**
- Same grouping display logic as US2 (today/tomorrow/x days).
- On-click → launch Branch Dashboard.
- 🔧 Assumption: a new API is required to access this data (per Confluence notes).

### US4 — Required Actions: Cash Management
- Source app: **My Cash Manager** (Enterprise Cash Management System UI — SEAL 89850)
- Data elements: total count of open My Cash Manager tasks (ATM, TCR, Cash boxes, Cash vaults). **No due date included.**
- Note: Cash Audits are handled by the Branch Ops team, **not** shown in this tile.
- On-click → launch My Cash Manager.
- ⚠️ Product Owner for this data source is currently unassigned — "Meeting with Zane and Amber to review" (per observability matrix). Data Owner: Ravi Patel.
- 🔧 Assumption: a new API is required.

### US5 — Required Actions: Branch Dashboard (aggregate tile)
- Source app: **Branch Dashboard** (SEAL 84329)
- Data elements: Action Items → Missing Documentation/Validation, Open Issues.
- ✅ **Decision (7/31/26, Eric Prock):** Tiles display the count of upcoming due items and the number of days until they're due. If no items are due, show the count of items with no due date.
- ⚠️ Open question: CTR/MIPL Work Returns must be completed within 2 days — should this get a **separate callout tile**, or stay rolled into this aggregate tile? *Not yet decided — build the aggregate tile now; leave a clean extension point for a possible dedicated CTR/MIPL tile.*
- On-click → launch Branch Dashboard.

### US6 — Required Actions: ICSC
- Launched from Branch Dashboard (SEAL 84329).
- Data elements: count of open items for the current month. `"due in <x> days"` = countdown to the **last business day of the month**.
- On-click → launch Branch Dashboard (ICSC view). See §7 for full ICSC field spec (reference for a related/adjacent view, useful for tile logic).

### US7 — Required Actions: Banker Notifications
**As a** branch manager, **I want** to see unread Banker Notifications **so that** I'm aware of items needing my attention.
- Source app: **Banker Homepage** (SEAL 104294)
- Data elements: any items on the Notifications tab + stories tagged "Control".
- Decrement logic: when the user clicks the tile, **assume all notifications are read and reset the counter to zero.** "Unread" = any notification posted since the last time the user clicked the tile.
- ⚠️ Still flagged as an open functional question in the Decision Log (7/31/26) — treat the above as the working assumption, confirm before hardening the counter-reset behavior.
- On-click → launch Banker Homepage.

